# Bishop of Wings made an Angel by Arcane Adaptation (Angel chosen) triggers on itself (ruling 2019-07-12): it enters an Angel, so
# "Whenever an Angel you control enters" gains Bot1 4 life (24); it dies to Wrath of God an Angel, and looking back as it last was
# on the battlefield (CR 603.10a) "Whenever an Angel you control dies" makes a Spirit. The Spirit enters an Angel too, but the
# Bishop is gone by then, so no more life: 24 stays.

